WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.096
Tẽngã sẽn da pa zãr ne-a wã, sor n yi weoogẽ wã n sigd kug-kãsems sʋka.

00:00:06.176 --> 00:00:11.401
Koɛɛgã pʋgẽ, koɛɛgã koglame n lebg koɛɛg sẽn yaa sik-m-menga.

00:00:11.481 --> 00:00:18.099
Kãsem-dãmbã yetame tɩ d pa tõe n wa n kẽng zĩig ning d sẽn dat n tɩ yi wã ye.

00:00:18.179 --> 00:00:25.492
D sã n maand woto ne sũ-bʋgsem, ne gũusgu, la ne waoogre, d na n paama sũ-noog wʋsgo.
